{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux执行xdg-open。对应需求：执行。官方：XDG-Open Command Execution。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux执行xdg-open","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux执行xdg-open\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机或容器内执行代码\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":47,"rule_id":"904023d7-8307-48bc-ad49-c454dfc2fae3","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and\nevent.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"executed\", \"process_started\", \"ProcessRollup2\") and (\n  process.name == \"xdg-open\" or\n  process.args in (\"/bin/xdg-open\", \"/usr/bin/xdg-open\", \"/usr/local/bin/xdg-open\", \"xdg-open\")\n)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"name":"Execution","id":"TA0002","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1204","name":"User Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1204.001","name":"Malicious Link","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/001/"},{"id":"T1204.002","name":"Malicious File","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/002/"},{"id":"T1204.004","name":"Malicious Copy and Paste","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/004/"}]}]}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
